* B1 -- Ni2 on coronene
* OpenMolcas: MS-CASPT2 on the SINGLET (S=0) manifold in the
* COMPACT CAS(12,12) active space (see caspt2_Q.input header for rationale).
* Reads the cheap-tier singlet natural orbitals rasscf_S.RasOrb.

&GATEWAY
 coord = opt_optimized.xyz
 basis = Def2-TZVP
 group = nosym
 amfi
 RICD

&SEWARD

&RASSCF
 fileorb = rasscf_S.RasOrb
 cionly
 charge = 0; spin = 1
 nactel = 12 0 0
 inactive = 100
 ras2 = 12
 ciroot = 5 5 1
 thrs = 1.0d-7 1.0d-5 1.0d-5
 outorbital = canonical

&CASPT2
 multistate = 5 1 2 3 4 5
 imag = 0.2
 ipeashift = 0.25
